      "writtenOn": "2026-10-16T08:55:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e What do you generally think about current approach? Do you see a problem that flash SPI runs at 100MHz for a short period?\n\nI believe it is the hardware\u0027s initial power-on reset (POR) value. I have verified this behavior through JTAG live debugging.\nI have tested running the flash at 100MHz and it works, but the spec is 60MHz, so I wouldn\u0027t recommend it. Overclocking does not guarantee that all modules will work properly, even for a short duration.",
